Hi Thomas,

Please add an annotation statement to your last line of code i.e.

# Create a map with Pike County and Warren County in red

ky_base +

labs(title = "Kentucky Counties of Importance to the Study") +

geom_polygon(data = ky_county, fill = NA, color = "black") +

geom_polygon(color = "black", fill = NA) +

geom_polygon(data = multiple_county_ky, fill = "red", color = "white") +

theme_void() +

  annotate("label", x = -86.5, y = 37.0, label = "Warren County",

           colour = "black", size = 5, fontface = "bold") +

  annotate("label", x = -82.4, y = 37.5, label = "Warren County",

           colour = "black", size = 5, fontface = "bold")

Best regards,

W

