Hi,

Is there a way to use different scales in each panel for facet_grid? I know, scale="free". but it doesn't work. All y-axis is the same for each panel.

Let's say I have five different panels (like  A, B, C, D, E). In these panels, for example, I have 8 columns in A panel,  12 columns in B, 5 columns in C, 8 in D, 8 in E.
Let's say, 3 columns have data but 5 columns have zero in A. 11 columns have data, one is zero in B panel. And I want to show all columns for each panel (even if zero) but panels have different scales.
And when I tried scales="free_x", only columns which have data, (not zero ones) come in the figure.

